---
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.jsx';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Fitur - Kamomi.id</title>
    <script is:inline>
      const theme = localStorage.getItem('theme');
      if (theme === 'dark' || (!theme && window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches)) {
        document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
      } else {
        document.documentElement.classList.remove('dark');
      }
    </script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans transition-colors duration-300 antialiased scroll-smooth">
    <Navbar client:load />

    <main class="flex-1 pt-32 pb-20 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12">
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-950/40 text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-200/30">
            ⚡ Fitur Utama
          </span>
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-800 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
            Fitur Cerdas Kamomi untuk Kost & Homestay
          </h1>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">
            Segala kemudahan informasi kamar dalam satu genggaman tamu
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {/* Feature 1 */}
          <div class="glassmorphic rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/50 dark:border-slate-800/50 shadow-md">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v1m0 11v1m5-6h-1m-7 0H4M8 12a4 4 0 118 0 4 4 0 01-8 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white text-base">QR Code Pintu Kamar</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Buat dan ekspor kartu desain QR code unik untuk setiap kamar Anda. Cetak dalam bentuk stiker atau papan akrilik untuk ditempel di pintu atau meja kamar.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Feature 2 */}
          <div class="glassmorphic rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/50 dark:border-slate-800/50 shadow-md">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.111 16.404a5.5 5.5 0 017.778 0M12 20h.01m-7.08-7.071a10.5 10.5 0 0114.14 0M1.344 6.564a16.5 16.5 0 0121.312 0" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white text-base">Koneksi Wi-Fi Instan</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Tamu tidak perlu repot mengetik password WiFi yang panjang. Cukup tekan tombol salin, atau scan langsung untuk terhubung otomatis ke internet.
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Feature 3 */}
          <div class="glassmorphic rounded-2xl p-6 border border-slate-200/50 dark:border-slate-800/50 shadow-md">
            <div class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-950/60 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-white text-base">Aturan Kost Interaktif</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Hadirkan tata tertib kamar (Quiet Hours, aturan kunjungan) secara interaktif. Bebas mengubah aturan kapan saja lewat dashboard tanpa mencetak ulang kertas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    {/* Footer */}
    <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 py-12 px-4 border-t border-slate-800 mt-auto">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">Kamomi<span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">.id</span></span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">© 2026 Kamomi.id. All rights reserved. Slogan: "Asisten Pintar Kamar Kamu"</p>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a href="/terms" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-white transition-colors">Syarat & Ketentuan</a>
          <a href="/privacy" class="text-xs text-slate-500 hover:text-white transition-colors">Kebijakan Privasi</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
